1
00:01:30,566 --> 00:01:31,551
=Tigers Sniff the Rose=

2
00:01:31,551 --> 00:01:33,560
(Based on the novel of the same name by Yiren Kuikui)

3
00:01:35,060 --> 00:01:38,900
=Episode 6=

4
00:01:56,500 --> 00:01:57,020
What?

5
00:01:57,260 --> 00:01:58,580
Does my chair bite?

6
00:01:59,100 --> 00:01:59,980
Why are you just standing there?

7
00:02:01,180 --> 00:02:01,460
Your...

8
00:02:02,100 --> 00:02:02,820
Your Highness.

9
00:02:08,260 --> 00:02:11,140
How's that immortality elixir

10
00:02:11,900 --> 00:02:12,420
I asked you to make?

11
00:02:14,140 --> 00:02:14,580
Your Highness,

12
00:02:15,060 --> 00:02:15,340
I...

13
00:02:16,340 --> 00:02:17,340
I can't make an elixir of immortality.

14
00:02:23,380 --> 00:02:24,380
You can't?

15
00:02:27,940 --> 00:02:28,700
So...

16
00:02:29,660 --> 00:02:31,820
you don't want to be my consort?

17
00:02:45,220 --> 00:02:46,700
All right, I'm just teasing you.

18
00:02:47,220 --> 00:02:48,100
I have nothing else planned tonight.

19
00:02:48,340 --> 00:02:49,260
I want to play backgammon with you.

20
00:03:00,660 --> 00:03:02,180
What do you think

21
00:03:02,780 --> 00:03:03,500
of that Yan Shang

22
00:03:04,460 --> 00:03:05,300
you were with today?

23
00:03:06,500 --> 00:03:06,980
Yan Shang?

24
00:03:08,380 --> 00:03:08,980
He's a good man.

25
00:03:10,020 --> 00:03:10,740
He's kind, too.

26
00:03:11,580 --> 00:03:12,380
He's always so nice to everyone.

27
00:03:13,380 --> 00:03:15,780
Lucky you never ran into bad people,

28
00:03:16,500 --> 00:03:18,420
or there'd be nothing left of you.

29
00:03:28,620 --> 00:03:29,700
What's got you so torn?

30
00:03:33,460 --> 00:03:33,940
Your Highness,

31
00:03:35,500 --> 00:03:36,100
today,

32
00:03:36,940 --> 00:03:38,340
besides Yan Shang and me,

33
00:03:39,220 --> 00:03:40,140
there was another friend.

34
00:03:46,660 --> 00:03:47,340
And?

35
00:03:49,820 --> 00:03:50,380
His name is...

36
00:03:51,220 --> 00:03:52,020
Feng Xianyu.

37
00:03:52,540 --> 00:03:53,380
He's very talented.

38
00:03:53,980 --> 00:03:54,740
- He said...
- So...

39
00:03:55,100 --> 00:03:56,460
this Mr. Feng

40
00:03:57,460 --> 00:03:58,700
sent you to me

41
00:03:59,660 --> 00:04:00,460
to recommend him?

42
00:04:04,860 --> 00:04:06,140
Look at you, Wei Shu.

43
00:04:07,020 --> 00:04:08,300
Li Zhi says you're clever,

44
00:04:09,100 --> 00:04:11,660
but you're a real fool, aren't you?

45
00:04:13,580 --> 00:04:16,020
Whenever you do something
against your conscience,

46
00:04:16,140 --> 00:04:17,460
you can barely get the words out.

47
00:04:18,460 --> 00:04:20,260
So why did you agree to it?

48
00:04:21,060 --> 00:04:21,580
Your Highness...

49
00:04:22,380 --> 00:04:23,340
Don't you realize

50
00:04:23,700 --> 00:04:24,860
you're both taking the imperial exams?

51
00:04:25,180 --> 00:04:26,380
You'll be competing against each other.

52
00:04:27,460 --> 00:04:27,860
Yes.

53
00:04:28,540 --> 00:04:30,860
You recommended him to me today.

54
00:04:31,460 --> 00:04:32,260
What about you?

55
00:04:33,620 --> 00:04:35,820
What if I took a fancy to him

56
00:04:36,260 --> 00:04:36,900
and

57
00:04:37,420 --> 00:04:38,220
recommended him

58
00:04:38,580 --> 00:04:39,420
instead of you?

59
00:04:40,060 --> 00:04:41,060
What would you do then?

60
00:04:45,780 --> 00:04:46,220
Your Highness,

61
00:04:47,100 --> 00:04:47,580
I'm sorry.

62
00:04:48,980 --> 00:04:49,580
You're right.

63
00:04:50,580 --> 00:04:51,460
If I can't bring myself

64
00:04:51,900 --> 00:04:52,700
to go against my conscience,

65
00:04:53,220 --> 00:04:54,180
I shouldn't have agreed.

66
00:04:54,500 --> 00:04:55,660
My mentor gave me an order,

67
00:04:56,500 --> 00:04:57,340
but I simply can't carry it out.

68
00:05:01,460 --> 00:05:02,140
I'm returning

69
00:05:03,140 --> 00:05:03,900
this cloak to you.

70
00:05:05,020 --> 00:05:06,340
Tomorrow, I'll ask the Director

71
00:05:06,780 --> 00:05:07,700
to expel me.

72
00:05:11,580 --> 00:05:12,900
Aren't you afraid

73
00:05:14,220 --> 00:05:15,220
Li Zhi will punish you?

74
00:05:18,660 --> 00:05:19,940
I'll apologize to my mentor.

75
00:05:21,100 --> 00:05:22,140
Your Highness, punish me as well.

76
00:05:24,420 --> 00:05:24,980
Wei Shu,

77
00:05:25,580 --> 00:05:26,660
you're quite adorable.

78
00:05:28,980 --> 00:05:29,740
Sit down. Relax.

79
00:05:30,540 --> 00:05:31,620
I have real business
to discuss with you.

80
00:05:34,060 --> 00:05:34,540
Your Highness...

81
00:05:34,860 --> 00:05:35,340
Sit.

82
00:05:37,820 --> 00:05:38,180
Yes.

83
00:05:46,660 --> 00:05:47,100
Wei Shu,

84
00:05:48,020 --> 00:05:48,660
listen carefully.

85
00:05:49,300 --> 00:05:50,700
Your mentor is my uncle.

86
00:05:51,700 --> 00:05:53,940
You know family orders carry
equal weight.

87
00:05:54,740 --> 00:05:55,460
I'm just as trapped

88
00:05:55,780 --> 00:05:56,700
by his plans as you are.

89
00:05:57,180 --> 00:05:57,580
But I...

90
00:05:57,620 --> 00:05:58,900
Let me finish.

91
00:05:59,940 --> 00:06:00,420
Today,

92
00:06:01,100 --> 00:06:02,620
I'd like us to make a pact.

93
00:06:03,500 --> 00:06:04,340
We'll work together.

94
00:06:04,980 --> 00:06:06,660
Until your imperial exams,

95
00:06:07,220 --> 00:06:08,380
we'll play along

96
00:06:08,820 --> 00:06:09,900
to keep your mentor happy.

97
00:06:10,940 --> 00:06:12,780
Just focus on your studies.

98
00:06:13,820 --> 00:06:14,780
And don't worry

99
00:06:15,020 --> 00:06:16,580
about the Wei family giving you trouble.

100
00:06:17,380 --> 00:06:18,140
From now on,

101
00:06:18,820 --> 00:06:21,180
I'll protect you.

102
00:06:23,140 --> 00:06:24,020
You like making elixirs, don't you?

103
00:06:25,940 --> 00:06:27,300
Then I'll set aside

104
00:06:27,500 --> 00:06:28,500
a spare room for you here.

105
00:06:29,300 --> 00:06:31,580
I'll get you everything you need
for that.

106
00:06:32,180 --> 00:06:34,060
You can do as you please.

107
00:06:35,340 --> 00:06:35,780
Really?

108
00:06:37,140 --> 00:06:38,260
Don't get too excited just yet.

109
00:06:39,700 --> 00:06:41,380
If you really want to thank me,

110
00:06:41,980 --> 00:06:44,060
make me a few more elixirs.

111
00:06:45,300 --> 00:06:45,820
Your Highness...

112
00:06:46,580 --> 00:06:47,460
There's no rush.

113
00:06:47,780 --> 00:06:48,580
Take your time.

114
00:06:49,780 --> 00:06:50,900
Once you've made them,

115
00:06:51,220 --> 00:06:53,260
I'll let you leave the residence.

116
00:06:58,660 --> 00:06:59,140
Your Highness,

117
00:07:00,540 --> 00:07:01,700
why are you helping me?

118
00:07:03,700 --> 00:07:04,740
Because I admire you.

119
00:07:06,660 --> 00:07:07,540
I admire you

120
00:07:08,100 --> 00:07:09,100
for who you are.

121
00:07:10,220 --> 00:07:11,140
Not for your family,

122
00:07:11,740 --> 00:07:12,580
not for my uncle,

123
00:07:13,300 --> 00:07:15,380
and certainly not because
you're someone's pawn.

124
00:07:23,820 --> 00:07:25,300
Why are you bowing again?

125
00:07:26,380 --> 00:07:26,820
Your Highness,

126
00:07:28,100 --> 00:07:29,940
I misjudged you before.

127
00:07:30,740 --> 00:07:31,540
I owe you an apology.

128
00:07:33,540 --> 00:07:35,420
Don't be so quick to apologize.

129
00:07:35,980 --> 00:07:36,780
What if

130
00:07:37,180 --> 00:07:38,260
you were right?

131
00:07:51,020 --> 00:07:51,940
How's my embroidery?

132
00:07:54,860 --> 00:07:56,500
Your embroidery

133
00:07:57,140 --> 00:07:57,980
still needs work.

134
00:08:02,580 --> 00:08:03,820
You should get some rest, Your Highness.

135
00:08:07,620 --> 00:08:08,100
Listen.

136
00:08:10,540 --> 00:08:11,660
The wind's picked up tonight.

137
00:08:13,460 --> 00:08:15,100
The roses outside are just blooming.

138
00:08:15,900 --> 00:08:17,140
How many will be blown away?

139
00:08:19,140 --> 00:08:19,860
I can't sleep.

140
00:08:20,580 --> 00:08:21,620
Warm me a pot of wine.

141
00:08:25,260 --> 00:08:27,620
You slept like a log in Lingnan.

142
00:08:28,180 --> 00:08:29,940
Why are you back to your old ways?

143
00:08:30,580 --> 00:08:31,740
Now that you mention it,

144
00:08:32,500 --> 00:08:33,380
you're right.

145
00:08:35,580 --> 00:08:36,980
Those days in Lingnan,

146
00:08:37,700 --> 00:08:40,180
Yan Shang kept me company every night,

147
00:08:41,460 --> 00:08:43,460
telling me all kinds of wild tales.

148
00:08:43,740 --> 00:08:45,900
Yan Shang's in Sheng'an now, anyway.

149
00:08:46,420 --> 00:08:47,460
Why not summon him

150
00:08:47,580 --> 00:08:48,940
to keep you company at bedtime?

151
00:08:49,380 --> 00:08:50,300
Why would I summon him?

152
00:08:51,140 --> 00:08:52,180
Why not call Wei Shu instead?

153
00:08:54,060 --> 00:08:55,500
I'll go fetch Mr. Wei, then.

154
00:08:55,740 --> 00:08:56,340
Come back!

155
00:08:57,580 --> 00:08:58,660
He's such a blockhead.

156
00:08:59,220 --> 00:08:59,980
If you call him over,

157
00:09:00,300 --> 00:09:01,700
he'll just blink at me

158
00:09:02,300 --> 00:09:03,380
and barely say a word.

159
00:09:03,660 --> 00:09:05,380
So Yan Shang's the better choice.

160
00:09:08,500 --> 00:09:09,140
I'm going to bed.

161
00:09:09,660 --> 00:09:10,300
You should get some sleep, too.

162
00:09:10,980 --> 00:09:11,940
Stop nagging me.

163
00:09:22,500 --> 00:09:23,460
Keep this up,

164
00:09:23,980 --> 00:09:25,260
and you'll wear yourself out.

165
00:09:43,140 --> 00:09:47,140
♪The midsummer breeze
blows soft and sweet♪

166
00:09:47,140 --> 00:09:51,540
♪Fireflies dance freely
through the night♪

167
00:09:51,740 --> 00:09:55,800
♪Chasing the beauty
of this fleeting world♪

168
00:09:55,800 --> 00:09:59,900
♪A thousand lights turn night into day♪

169
00:10:00,100 --> 00:10:04,020
♪Cicada songs mingle with the wine♪

170
00:10:04,020 --> 00:10:08,420
♪Their songs linger
through the passing years♪

171
00:10:08,700 --> 00:10:12,710
♪Life is but a fleeting stay♪

172
00:10:12,710 --> 00:10:16,500
♪How lucky I am
to walk this path with you♪

173
00:10:17,340 --> 00:10:21,610
♪Playing out life's game,
forever by your side♪

174
00:10:21,610 --> 00:10:25,500
♪Innocent years drift gently by♪

175
00:10:25,900 --> 00:10:29,980
♪I wish time could stand still♪

176
00:10:29,980 --> 00:10:33,860
♪Forever at that crossroads♪

177
00:10:34,380 --> 00:10:37,970
♪Watching flowers bloom and fade♪

178
00:10:37,970 --> 00:10:42,180
♪Weathering life's rise and fall♪

179
00:10:42,820 --> 00:10:46,570
♪Where endless time comes to an end♪

180
00:10:46,570 --> 00:10:50,940
♪Moonlight and breeze
fill our boat home♪

181
00:10:51,660 --> 00:10:54,890
♪Golden winds and jade dew return♪
(At dusk...)

182
00:10:54,890 --> 00:11:00,020
♪The world still blooms as before♪
(At dusk...)

183
00:11:00,140 --> 00:11:03,400
♪How lucky to roam with you♪
(At dusk, a small boat rocks)

184
00:11:03,400 --> 00:11:08,340
♪Back to the road where it all began♪
(At dusk, a small boat rocks)

185
00:11:08,540 --> 00:11:12,700
♪As if our youthful hearts remain♪

186
00:11:12,860 --> 00:11:14,540
♪As if our love will never fade♪
(At dusk, a small boat rocks)

187
00:11:14,540 --> 00:11:15,220
(Your name)

188
00:11:16,700 --> 00:11:17,580
(doesn't just mean)

189
00:11:18,860 --> 00:11:19,940
("a dusk-bound journey)

190
00:11:21,220 --> 00:11:22,580
(through wind and rain.")

191
00:11:33,540 --> 00:11:35,260
(Lodge of Wisdom)

192
00:11:36,500 --> 00:11:36,940
Wenji,

193
00:11:37,580 --> 00:11:38,940
I'm going to the West Market for ink.

194
00:11:39,460 --> 00:11:40,780
Are you running low on ink sticks, too?

195
00:11:40,980 --> 00:11:44,300
(Bamboo Dew)

196
00:11:44,300 --> 00:11:44,620
Wenji?

197
00:11:46,340 --> 00:11:46,620
Wenji?

198
00:11:48,660 --> 00:11:49,340
W-What's wrong?

199
00:11:50,180 --> 00:11:50,460
You...

200
00:11:51,140 --> 00:11:52,180
Is something bothering you?

201
00:11:52,900 --> 00:11:53,540
Ever since we settled here,

202
00:11:54,100 --> 00:11:55,340
you've seemed distracted.

203
00:11:56,260 --> 00:11:57,180
N-No, nothing.

204
00:11:57,700 --> 00:11:58,020
I...

205
00:11:58,980 --> 00:11:59,900
(Lodge of Wisdom)
The imperial exams are near.

206
00:12:00,460 --> 00:12:02,300
Nothing matters but studying.

207
00:12:13,140 --> 00:12:13,460
(No, this won't do.)

208
00:12:14,380 --> 00:12:15,500
(I still have to see her.)

209
00:12:16,220 --> 00:12:16,620
(Otherwise,)

210
00:12:17,260 --> 00:12:18,380
(how can I study in peace?)

211
00:12:32,460 --> 00:12:32,740
Yan Shang.

212
00:12:34,060 --> 00:12:34,500
Tell me,

213
00:12:34,940 --> 00:12:36,660
which outfit suits me better?

214
00:12:37,700 --> 00:12:38,460
What about this yellow one?

215
00:12:40,140 --> 00:12:40,500
This one.

216
00:12:42,100 --> 00:12:42,420
Which one?

217
00:12:44,260 --> 00:12:44,740
This one, I guess.

218
00:12:45,660 --> 00:12:45,980
This one?

219
00:12:47,500 --> 00:12:50,700
(Princess Danyang's Residence)

220
00:13:01,660 --> 00:13:02,700
(Liu Wenji...)

221
00:13:03,500 --> 00:13:04,460
(What are you doing?)

222
00:13:06,340 --> 00:13:08,220
(Princess Danyang's Residence)
(She's the princess's personal maid.)

223
00:13:09,100 --> 00:13:09,660
(Today,)

224
00:13:10,140 --> 00:13:11,300
(she might not even go out.)

225
00:13:15,940 --> 00:13:16,580
Liu Wenji!

226
00:13:19,260 --> 00:13:20,220
You've come to Sheng'an, too!

227
00:13:36,020 --> 00:13:37,060
Why so quiet?

228
00:13:40,980 --> 00:13:41,500
Seeing you...

229
00:13:42,460 --> 00:13:43,220
makes me so happy.

230
00:13:46,620 --> 00:13:47,180
Were you

231
00:13:47,820 --> 00:13:49,860
just passing by here?

232
00:13:52,420 --> 00:13:53,220
Yes, just passing by.

233
00:13:53,820 --> 00:13:54,540
I just happened to...

234
00:13:55,020 --> 00:13:55,700
run into you.

235
00:13:58,740 --> 00:13:59,780
Sheng'an is such a big place,

236
00:14:00,340 --> 00:14:01,060
with so many people.

237
00:14:02,380 --> 00:14:03,340
To run into you again,

238
00:14:03,580 --> 00:14:04,460
it must be fate!

239
00:14:09,300 --> 00:14:10,100
Where are you headed?

240
00:14:11,620 --> 00:14:12,300
Back to my lodgings.

241
00:14:12,740 --> 00:14:13,300
Where are you staying?

242
00:14:13,460 --> 00:14:14,380
I'll visit sometime.

243
00:14:14,940 --> 00:14:16,260
I've been staying with Yan Shang

244
00:14:16,260 --> 00:14:17,500
in a meditation room at Yongshou Temple.

245
00:14:17,860 --> 00:14:20,140
You're staying with Yan Shang
at Yongshou Temple?

246
00:14:22,820 --> 00:14:24,020
Come on. I'll go there with you.

247
00:14:25,820 --> 00:14:26,460
That won't do!

248
00:14:27,140 --> 00:14:27,940
Why not?

249
00:14:31,380 --> 00:14:31,820
Well...

250
00:14:33,380 --> 00:14:33,900
We...

251
00:14:34,340 --> 00:14:35,860
don't have our parents' approval

252
00:14:37,380 --> 00:14:38,140
or a matchmaker's blessing yet.

253
00:14:38,700 --> 00:14:39,580
How could we...

254
00:14:41,100 --> 00:14:42,860
Liu Wenji, what are you thinking?

255
00:14:44,980 --> 00:14:46,460
I'm going to see Yan Shang.

256
00:14:46,860 --> 00:14:47,900
I need to ask him a favor.

257
00:14:49,820 --> 00:14:50,820
Y-Yan Shang?

258
00:15:01,180 --> 00:15:01,500
Well...

259
00:15:02,420 --> 00:15:02,980
Then let's go.

260
00:15:03,260 --> 00:15:03,540
Let's go!

261
00:15:06,780 --> 00:15:07,540
Oh, I almost forgot my horse.

262
00:15:21,180 --> 00:15:22,660
Your Royal Highness, the tea is ready.

263
00:15:45,500 --> 00:15:45,940
Your Royal Highness.

264
00:15:47,660 --> 00:15:48,940
(Yang Si, third son of noble Yangs)
I've come all this way.

265
00:15:49,140 --> 00:15:50,340
Can't I catch my breath?

266
00:15:51,180 --> 00:15:52,020
We've barely traded a few moves,

267
00:15:52,500 --> 00:15:53,300
and you already need a rest?

268
00:15:55,500 --> 00:15:58,020
(Chongli Hall)

269
00:16:02,860 --> 00:16:05,100
(Lingbai Pavilion)

270
00:16:05,100 --> 00:16:07,780
(Chongli Hall)

271
00:16:11,900 --> 00:16:13,060
This tea was prepared
for His Royal Highness.

272
00:16:13,820 --> 00:16:14,140
No matter.

273
00:16:14,780 --> 00:16:16,180
Pour him another cup.

274
00:16:18,740 --> 00:16:19,260
Thank you.

275
00:16:31,300 --> 00:16:31,660
Well?

276
00:16:33,180 --> 00:16:34,500
Your tea is still the best.

277
00:16:35,060 --> 00:16:35,620
Mr. Yang,

278
00:16:36,380 --> 00:16:37,860
that's a Yue ware cup
reserved for His Royal Highness.

279
00:16:38,220 --> 00:16:39,180
(Lingbai Pavilion)
The tea's Mengding tea.

280
00:16:39,660 --> 00:16:40,740
And you gulp it down like a horse!

281
00:16:40,860 --> 00:16:42,620
How'd you know I learned it from horses?

282
00:16:43,460 --> 00:16:45,140
It's a quick way to kill your thirst.

283
00:16:45,900 --> 00:16:47,140
Your Royal Highness, you have no idea.

284
00:16:47,340 --> 00:16:48,420
I've been on the road for days.

285
00:16:48,860 --> 00:16:50,420
You've had a rough journey.

286
00:16:52,820 --> 00:16:54,780
Your Royal Highness,
why did you summon me back

287
00:16:55,380 --> 00:16:55,780
in such a hurry?

288
00:16:56,900 --> 00:16:57,300
Come in.

289
00:16:58,020 --> 00:16:58,660
Mind the step.

290
00:17:05,820 --> 00:17:06,700
We haven't tidied up in days,

291
00:17:07,260 --> 00:17:07,900
so it's a bit of a mess.

292
00:17:13,140 --> 00:17:13,780
Where's Yan Shang?

293
00:17:15,180 --> 00:17:16,340
The Imperial Academy
let out early today.

294
00:17:16,780 --> 00:17:17,620
He was still there when I left.

295
00:17:17,900 --> 00:17:19,260
He may have gone out by now.

296
00:17:24,820 --> 00:17:25,420
Have a seat.

297
00:17:25,660 --> 00:17:26,820
I-I'll get you some tea.

298
00:17:38,380 --> 00:17:40,140
(Confucius said...)

299
00:18:08,220 --> 00:18:09,500
Wasn't that tea for me?

300
00:18:13,460 --> 00:18:13,860
The tea...

301
00:18:17,740 --> 00:18:18,060
Here.

302
00:18:28,140 --> 00:18:28,900
Careful, it's hot.

303
00:18:39,700 --> 00:18:40,660
Funny how fate works.

304
00:18:41,060 --> 00:18:42,100
I hadn't left home in days,

305
00:18:42,500 --> 00:18:43,540
but the one time I went out today,

306
00:18:43,660 --> 00:18:44,660
I happened to run into you.

307
00:18:47,020 --> 00:18:47,780
I...

308
00:18:48,420 --> 00:18:49,540
I've been in Sheng'an for days.

309
00:18:51,660 --> 00:18:52,580
I've wanted to see you.

310
00:18:53,860 --> 00:18:54,580
It's just...

311
00:18:57,060 --> 00:18:57,620
Just what?

312
00:19:00,260 --> 00:19:01,500
The princess's residence
is heavily guarded,

313
00:19:01,700 --> 00:19:02,820
and I have no official title.

314
00:19:03,420 --> 00:19:04,580
Besides, you have to serve the princess.

315
00:19:06,540 --> 00:19:07,300
What's so difficult about that?

316
00:19:07,820 --> 00:19:09,260
I can come see you, too.

317
00:19:14,100 --> 00:19:15,380
You have so many books here.

318
00:19:19,580 --> 00:19:20,340
The exams are coming up.

319
00:19:21,140 --> 00:19:21,660
I should...

320
00:19:23,620 --> 00:19:24,900
I should focus on my studies.

321
00:19:29,980 --> 00:19:32,780
So you came to the capital
for the exams.

322
00:19:33,660 --> 00:19:36,740
Didn't you come top
in the prefectural exams?

323
00:19:38,180 --> 00:19:38,980
It was nothing.

324
00:19:40,740 --> 00:19:42,780
I'm not as impressive as you think.

325
00:19:43,500 --> 00:19:44,820
Sheng'an is full of talented scholars.

326
00:19:45,260 --> 00:19:46,300
My father always warned me

327
00:19:47,060 --> 00:19:48,620
not to grow proud or arrogant.

328
00:19:54,820 --> 00:19:55,780
Studying is hard enough.

329
00:19:56,100 --> 00:19:57,020
You came first.

330
00:19:57,300 --> 00:19:58,460
You deserve praise.

331
00:19:58,780 --> 00:19:59,700
You've earned it.

332
00:20:04,340 --> 00:20:04,740
Chunhua,

333
00:20:06,180 --> 00:20:07,340
you're the first person

334
00:20:08,540 --> 00:20:09,580
to ever tell me that.

335
00:20:12,820 --> 00:20:13,260
Thank you.

336
00:20:14,220 --> 00:20:14,660
You're welcome.

337
00:20:27,540 --> 00:20:27,980
Chunhua,

338
00:20:28,900 --> 00:20:29,460
why do you

339
00:20:30,420 --> 00:20:31,660
want to see Yan Shang?

340
00:20:34,780 --> 00:20:37,020
Actually, I'm not the one
who wants to see him.

341
00:20:37,460 --> 00:20:38,580
It's the princess.

342
00:20:40,180 --> 00:20:40,500
No, that's not right.

343
00:20:41,300 --> 00:20:43,620
I'm looking for Yan Shang
on the princess's behalf.

344
00:20:46,340 --> 00:20:47,060
When he gets back,

345
00:20:47,340 --> 00:20:48,420
could you tell him

346
00:20:48,580 --> 00:20:49,740
to come to the princess's residence?

347
00:20:49,820 --> 00:20:50,700
I need to ask him a favor.

348
00:20:51,940 --> 00:20:52,300
All right.

349
00:20:52,900 --> 00:20:53,220
I'll tell him.

350
00:20:54,260 --> 00:20:54,740
Thank you.

351
00:20:56,220 --> 00:20:57,460
I still have things to buy
for the princess,

352
00:20:57,580 --> 00:20:58,100
so I'd better go.

353
00:20:58,220 --> 00:20:58,940
I won't keep you from studying.

354
00:21:08,180 --> 00:21:08,860
Oh, Wenji...

355
00:21:09,260 --> 00:21:10,140
Why did you want to see me?

356
00:21:10,660 --> 00:21:10,940
I...

357
00:21:13,580 --> 00:21:14,460
Never mind. I'd better go.

358
00:21:14,620 --> 00:21:15,340
I'll visit when I have time.

359
00:21:24,420 --> 00:21:24,860
Chunhua!

360
00:21:25,300 --> 00:21:25,740
Chunhua!

361
00:21:29,060 --> 00:21:29,500
What's wrong?

362
00:21:30,260 --> 00:21:31,140
Did I leave anything behind?

363
00:21:34,020 --> 00:21:34,500
Chunhua,

364
00:21:35,580 --> 00:21:36,460
on the tenth of the third month,

365
00:21:37,060 --> 00:21:38,220
there'll be a peony festival
in Jinchang Ward.

366
00:21:38,820 --> 00:21:39,460
It's quite a spectacle.

367
00:21:40,300 --> 00:21:41,260
Let's go together.

368
00:21:45,500 --> 00:21:46,220
Is that an invitation?

369
00:21:48,620 --> 00:21:49,020
Yes.

370
00:21:50,780 --> 00:21:52,220
No one's ever invited me before.

371
00:21:52,660 --> 00:21:54,700
People used to invite the princess.

372
00:21:55,020 --> 00:21:55,260
I...

373
00:21:55,260 --> 00:21:55,860
I'm inviting you, and only you!

374
00:22:09,540 --> 00:22:10,020
I'd love to.

375
00:22:10,780 --> 00:22:11,500
I'll be there for sure.

376
00:22:35,740 --> 00:22:36,860
(To My Esteemed Father:)

377
00:22:38,540 --> 00:22:40,820
(I've been in the capital
for several days.)

378
00:22:41,860 --> 00:22:43,060
(I'll heed your teachings)

379
00:22:43,940 --> 00:22:45,220
(and never forget my duty)

380
00:22:46,100 --> 00:22:47,740
(to bring honor to our family.)

381
00:23:04,420 --> 00:23:08,700
(to bring honor to our family.)

382
00:23:17,700 --> 00:23:19,170
("To My Esteemed Father...)

383
00:23:19,170 --> 00:23:20,740
(... to bring honor to our family.")

384
00:23:34,580 --> 00:23:34,980
Wenji,

385
00:23:35,780 --> 00:23:36,780
I've bought new ink and brushes.

386
00:23:37,300 --> 00:23:37,620
Yan Shang.

387
00:23:39,420 --> 00:23:40,380
Leave those for now.

388
00:23:40,620 --> 00:23:41,740
Chunhua told me

389
00:23:41,900 --> 00:23:43,700
she wants you
at the princess's residence

390
00:23:44,100 --> 00:23:45,100
for a favor.

391
00:23:55,500 --> 00:23:56,060
What's this?

392
00:23:57,580 --> 00:23:58,380
A peace offering.

393
00:24:00,380 --> 00:24:02,980
(Qingfeng Pavilion)

394
00:24:27,460 --> 00:24:27,940
Yang Si!

395
00:24:29,260 --> 00:24:29,900
Get out here!

396
00:24:35,140 --> 00:24:35,460
Wanyao!

397
00:24:38,220 --> 00:24:39,020
What brings you back?

398
00:24:40,860 --> 00:24:41,700
Things have been quiet at the border,

399
00:24:42,300 --> 00:24:43,180
so I left the army and came home.

400
00:24:45,340 --> 00:24:46,140
It's been three years.

401
00:24:47,100 --> 00:24:48,140
I've just returned from North Jing, too.

402
00:24:54,020 --> 00:24:54,340
Here.

403
00:24:59,620 --> 00:25:00,420
After all this time,

404
00:25:01,020 --> 00:25:02,260
you greet me with a bag of fruit?

405
00:25:02,940 --> 00:25:04,260
These aren't ordinary fruits.

406
00:25:05,140 --> 00:25:05,660
They're

407
00:25:06,260 --> 00:25:07,060
tribute fruits.

408
00:25:09,060 --> 00:25:10,020
You got them from the Crown Prince?

409
00:25:14,060 --> 00:25:15,820
You know how hard life is in the army.

410
00:25:16,340 --> 00:25:17,980
My pay barely covers my wine.

411
00:25:18,500 --> 00:25:21,740
So I swiped some fruit to make do.

412
00:25:22,660 --> 00:25:22,940
No, I mean,

413
00:25:23,460 --> 00:25:24,100
as a gift for you.

414
00:25:25,420 --> 00:25:27,220
Some big name in Sheng'an you are!

415
00:25:27,780 --> 00:25:28,700
If you can't afford wine,

416
00:25:28,780 --> 00:25:29,740
go charm some people for money.

417
00:25:30,140 --> 00:25:31,540
Plenty of young ladies in Sheng'an

418
00:25:32,020 --> 00:25:33,500
would gladly buy you wine.

419
00:25:34,140 --> 00:25:34,540
Wanyao.

420
00:25:35,020 --> 00:25:35,980
What are you implying?

421
00:25:36,620 --> 00:25:37,340
Are you jealous?

422
00:25:43,380 --> 00:25:43,780
Tell me,

423
00:25:44,700 --> 00:25:45,620
why did the Crown Prince

424
00:25:46,100 --> 00:25:46,660
send you here?

425
00:25:55,260 --> 00:25:56,300
(Yan Shang, come on! Hurry!)

426
00:26:12,660 --> 00:26:13,060
Yan Shang.

427
00:26:43,020 --> 00:26:43,460
(Yan Shang!)

428
00:26:44,020 --> 00:26:44,420
(Come on!)

429
00:26:49,740 --> 00:26:50,100
Wanyao,

430
00:26:50,820 --> 00:26:52,060
you know I always speak my mind.

431
00:26:53,300 --> 00:26:53,780
Lately,

432
00:26:54,620 --> 00:26:56,780
Yu Cheng'an has been acting
like he owns the court.

433
00:26:58,020 --> 00:26:58,300
And...

434
00:26:59,100 --> 00:27:00,620
you bear that ominous prophecy.

435
00:27:01,740 --> 00:27:02,580
Have you ever thought

436
00:27:02,780 --> 00:27:03,740
that with one word from him,

437
00:27:04,700 --> 00:27:06,780
you could be sent back to North Jing,

438
00:27:07,700 --> 00:27:08,140
or

439
00:27:08,860 --> 00:27:10,020
married off to someone else?

440
00:27:10,260 --> 00:27:10,980
So?

441
00:27:13,900 --> 00:27:14,420
I'll

442
00:27:15,340 --> 00:27:16,100
make a sacrifice

443
00:27:17,340 --> 00:27:17,820
and marry you.

444
00:27:18,820 --> 00:27:19,180
What do you say?

445
00:27:19,620 --> 00:27:20,220
No way.

446
00:27:22,500 --> 00:27:23,420
Why would you marry me?

447
00:27:25,020 --> 00:27:25,780
Because you like me?

448
00:27:33,380 --> 00:27:34,620
Whether I like you or not...

449
00:27:34,620 --> 00:27:35,900
w-what does that matter?

450
00:27:36,300 --> 00:27:37,060
We grew up together.

451
00:27:37,060 --> 00:27:38,020
Why bring that up now?

452
00:27:38,820 --> 00:27:39,940
I can't just leave you
to fend for yourself.

453
00:27:40,100 --> 00:27:40,820
Then don't bring it up.

454
00:27:41,860 --> 00:27:43,180
Even if it's just a marriage
of convenience?

455
00:27:45,380 --> 00:27:46,140
Wanyao!

456
00:27:47,020 --> 00:27:47,460
One more thing.

457
00:27:48,620 --> 00:27:49,460
I'm all grown up now.

458
00:27:50,420 --> 00:27:51,420
Stop treating me like a child.

459
00:27:53,020 --> 00:27:54,460
Your Highness, look who's here!

460
00:28:06,380 --> 00:28:06,780
Your Highness.

461
00:28:07,460 --> 00:28:08,100
I've come at a bad time.

462
00:28:08,780 --> 00:28:09,580
You certainly have.

463
00:28:12,300 --> 00:28:13,020
Why are you here?

464
00:28:13,620 --> 00:28:14,500
To thank me for getting you

465
00:28:15,020 --> 00:28:16,100
into the Imperial Academy?

466
00:28:27,980 --> 00:28:29,740
Is this the guy
your uncle picked for you?

467
00:28:31,740 --> 00:28:32,420
What was his name again?

468
00:28:32,820 --> 00:28:33,300
Wei Shu?

469
00:28:33,740 --> 00:28:34,180
Shut up!

470
00:28:35,540 --> 00:28:36,140
Look at you.

471
00:28:37,860 --> 00:28:39,100
You're from a noble family,

472
00:28:41,060 --> 00:28:42,900
yet you're practically begging
to be a male favorite.

473
00:28:44,180 --> 00:28:45,980
You think a pretty face
lets you get away with anything?

474
00:28:46,540 --> 00:28:47,660
And you call yourself educated?

475
00:28:47,820 --> 00:28:48,340
Yang Si!

476
00:28:50,700 --> 00:28:52,060
Wanyao, you're shouting at me!

477
00:28:52,540 --> 00:28:54,020
Over some outsider, no less!

478
00:28:54,420 --> 00:28:55,820
Weren't you trying to provoke me, too?

479
00:28:57,260 --> 00:28:58,540
That's different!

480
00:28:59,340 --> 00:29:00,620
I'm worried he'll deceive you.

481
00:29:01,260 --> 00:29:02,220
And now you're taking his side!

482
00:29:02,460 --> 00:29:03,260
You're even defending him!

483
00:29:04,140 --> 00:29:05,580
Mu Wanyao, you've changed.

484
00:29:05,580 --> 00:29:06,660
You've forgotten all about loyalty!

485
00:29:06,820 --> 00:29:07,420
Get lost!

486
00:29:08,100 --> 00:29:09,540
How old are you?
Aren't you tired of this?

487
00:29:14,740 --> 00:29:15,140
And you?

488
00:29:17,300 --> 00:29:18,460
What exactly are you here for?

489
00:29:21,300 --> 00:29:22,540
Your Highness is right.

490
00:29:23,380 --> 00:29:24,380
I came to thank you.

491
00:29:25,020 --> 00:29:25,580
That's all?

492
00:29:26,860 --> 00:29:28,820
A measly "thank you"? What good is that?

493
00:29:34,100 --> 00:29:34,980
Is this your token of gratitude?

494
00:29:38,220 --> 00:29:38,660
Hand it over.

495
00:29:40,700 --> 00:29:42,380
A thank-you gift? Let me see!

496
00:29:46,900 --> 00:29:48,260
You're awfully protective of it.

497
00:29:49,660 --> 00:29:50,780
I'll bet that box holds

498
00:29:51,220 --> 00:29:53,340
some lousy calligraphy or painting.

499
00:29:53,740 --> 00:29:54,500
What's so precious about that?

500
00:29:55,700 --> 00:29:58,340
Is it a painting by Gu Daozhi
or calligraphy by Liu Yici?

501
00:29:58,340 --> 00:29:59,420
That's none of your business.

502
00:30:10,580 --> 00:30:11,020
Give it to me.

503
00:30:19,220 --> 00:30:19,940
There's been a misunderstanding.

504
00:30:20,780 --> 00:30:21,220
This painting

505
00:30:21,860 --> 00:30:22,780
was a gift from a friend.

506
00:30:23,780 --> 00:30:25,220
It's not my thank-you gift
to Your Highness.

507
00:30:25,540 --> 00:30:26,140
Yan Shang!

508
00:30:27,060 --> 00:30:27,660
You tricked me!

509
00:30:28,660 --> 00:30:29,100
Your Highness,

510
00:30:29,780 --> 00:30:30,820
I'm not from a noble family.

511
00:30:31,380 --> 00:30:33,020
My family has no wealth,
and I own little of value.

512
00:30:33,460 --> 00:30:34,340
I truly have nothing to repay you with.

513
00:30:35,500 --> 00:30:35,820
However,

514
00:30:36,420 --> 00:30:37,540
if there's anything you want,

515
00:30:37,900 --> 00:30:39,420
that I can afford or do,

516
00:30:40,260 --> 00:30:41,700
I'll gladly do it for you.

517
00:30:42,020 --> 00:30:42,460
No need.

518
00:30:43,260 --> 00:30:44,620
I want nothing from you.

519
00:30:45,020 --> 00:30:45,340
Get out!

520
00:30:50,540 --> 00:30:50,980
In that case,

521
00:30:52,060 --> 00:30:52,860
I'll take my leave.

522
00:31:01,940 --> 00:31:03,420
Isn't he from the noble Wei family?

523
00:31:04,100 --> 00:31:05,260
How come he said he's not nobility?

524
00:31:05,740 --> 00:31:06,540
Why do you care?

525
00:31:07,300 --> 00:31:07,820
You get out, too!

526
00:31:08,300 --> 00:31:09,540
Stop annoying me here!

527
00:31:10,140 --> 00:31:10,420
Get out!

528
00:31:18,820 --> 00:31:19,220
Wanyao.

529
00:31:20,180 --> 00:31:20,660
Well...

530
00:31:20,940 --> 00:31:22,980
I'll let this slide.

531
00:31:23,260 --> 00:31:24,180
I'll come see you another day.

532
00:31:31,060 --> 00:31:31,820
Yang Si,

533
00:31:32,660 --> 00:31:33,820
you're despicable.

534
00:31:34,940 --> 00:31:36,860
You know perfectly well
she's being used.

535
00:31:37,580 --> 00:31:38,060
(Yang Si,)

536
00:31:38,900 --> 00:31:40,020
(if Danyang could marry you,)

537
00:31:40,740 --> 00:31:41,780
(I'd feel at ease about her.)

538
00:31:42,620 --> 00:31:43,420
(You're all I have.)

539
00:32:10,340 --> 00:32:14,860
(At dusk, a small boat rocks)

540
00:32:38,820 --> 00:32:42,700
(Imperial Academy; Gathering Auspice)

541
00:32:42,820 --> 00:32:43,260
Greetings, Chancellor Liu.

542
00:32:43,500 --> 00:32:43,860
Greetings, Chancellor Liu.

543
00:32:46,220 --> 00:32:47,020
(Mr. Li! Over here!)

544
00:32:47,260 --> 00:32:47,580
(This way!)

545
00:32:47,820 --> 00:32:48,100
(Here!)

546
00:32:48,460 --> 00:32:48,820
(Catch!)

547
00:32:48,820 --> 00:32:49,140
(Over here!)

548
00:32:49,140 --> 00:32:49,860
(Pass it!)

549
00:32:50,620 --> 00:32:51,820
They're playing foot polo?

550
00:32:51,900 --> 00:32:52,820
(Pass it! Mr. Li!)

551
00:32:53,300 --> 00:32:54,620
Those little rascals!

552
00:32:55,060 --> 00:32:56,540
(Director of the Imperial Academy)
They still have energy after class.

553
00:32:56,900 --> 00:32:58,340
They've got energy to spare.

554
00:32:59,540 --> 00:33:00,780
Getting more exercise

555
00:33:01,020 --> 00:33:02,460
is a good thing.

556
00:33:04,300 --> 00:33:05,660
(Liu Huaiyan, Retired Chancellor)
You always see things clearly.

557
00:33:06,020 --> 00:33:06,980
In your opinion,

558
00:33:07,540 --> 00:33:09,780
are there any promising talents

559
00:33:10,380 --> 00:33:12,020
among this year's young scholars?

560
00:33:12,700 --> 00:33:13,700
I believe

561
00:33:14,180 --> 00:33:16,500
there are always promising talents.

562
00:33:17,340 --> 00:33:20,220
Whether the court can make use of them

563
00:33:20,660 --> 00:33:22,220
depends on their fortunes.

564
00:33:23,500 --> 00:33:25,860
Take Wei Shu, for example.

565
00:33:26,460 --> 00:33:27,660
Though born to a concubine,

566
00:33:28,020 --> 00:33:29,260
he has extraordinary talent.

567
00:33:29,980 --> 00:33:33,100
It's a shame
he's so aloof and withdrawn.

568
00:33:34,660 --> 00:33:36,780
Then there's Feng Xianyu.

569
00:33:37,260 --> 00:33:39,540
He's Wei Shu's complete opposite.

570
00:33:39,900 --> 00:33:41,140
He's too restless and impulsive,

571
00:33:41,540 --> 00:33:43,540
so his character bears watching.

572
00:33:46,180 --> 00:33:46,740
Chancellor Liu, look.

573
00:33:47,900 --> 00:33:49,780
The student watching the game over there

574
00:33:50,100 --> 00:33:50,860
is Yan Shang.

575
00:33:51,420 --> 00:33:53,460
He's well-read and very bright.

576
00:33:54,260 --> 00:33:55,180
Yet somehow,

577
00:33:55,180 --> 00:33:57,460
he doesn't seem interested
in his studies.

578
00:33:57,540 --> 00:33:57,980
(Yan Shang!)

579
00:33:58,260 --> 00:33:59,260
I wonder why.

580
00:34:01,260 --> 00:34:01,780
(Mr. Li!)

581
00:34:01,900 --> 00:34:02,340
(Yan Shang,)

582
00:34:02,900 --> 00:34:03,860
(feeling better after that rest?)

583
00:34:04,100 --> 00:34:04,820
(Ready for another round?)

584
00:34:05,460 --> 00:34:06,260
(Come on! Want to try again?)

585
00:34:06,260 --> 00:34:07,020
(Come on, Yan Shang! Try!)

586
00:34:07,260 --> 00:34:07,700
- (Let's play!)
- (Come on!)

587
00:34:07,700 --> 00:34:08,220
(Come join us!)

588
00:34:12,420 --> 00:34:14,180
Come on, let's play chess.

589
00:34:29,820 --> 00:34:36,060
(Imperial Academy)

590
00:34:36,060 --> 00:34:36,780
Wei Shu, where are you going?

591
00:34:37,180 --> 00:34:37,820
Why don't we go together?

592
00:34:39,020 --> 00:34:40,180
I'm going to
Princess Danyang's residence.

593
00:34:40,700 --> 00:34:42,060
Feng Xianyu, care to join me?

594
00:34:44,580 --> 00:34:44,940
Well...

595
00:34:45,940 --> 00:34:47,020
I won't keep you.

596
00:34:53,740 --> 00:35:00,730
(Virtuous and Learned)

597
00:35:02,420 --> 00:35:02,820
What's wrong?

598
00:35:03,900 --> 00:35:04,740
Where are you headed?

599
00:35:06,500 --> 00:35:07,420
To seek a recommendation.

600
00:35:07,580 --> 00:35:08,060
What about you?

601
00:35:09,500 --> 00:35:10,500
Same as you.

602
00:35:12,140 --> 00:35:13,540
(Virtuous and Learned)

603
00:35:13,540 --> 00:35:13,980
Yan Shang,

604
00:35:15,340 --> 00:35:16,780
seeking a recommendation

605
00:35:16,980 --> 00:35:18,220
is a long, hard road

606
00:35:19,020 --> 00:35:20,140
to success.

607
00:35:21,340 --> 00:35:23,380
(Imperial Academy)
As the saying goes, enduring hardship

608
00:35:23,500 --> 00:35:24,420
makes you rise above the rest.

609
00:35:25,180 --> 00:35:26,220
(Mingde)
Wouldn't you agree?

610
00:35:27,820 --> 00:35:28,220
Feng Xianyu,

611
00:35:29,020 --> 00:35:29,940
I've read your poems and essays.

612
00:35:30,660 --> 00:35:32,220
You're talented and hardworking.

613
00:35:32,860 --> 00:35:34,980
I'm sure you'll go far one day.

614
00:35:37,780 --> 00:35:38,820
I'll remember your kind words.

615
00:35:39,780 --> 00:35:40,620
You and Wei Shu

616
00:35:41,180 --> 00:35:42,220
(Gathering Auspice)
have Princess Danyang's favor.

617
00:35:43,940 --> 00:35:45,300
You don't have the worries we do.

618
00:35:47,180 --> 00:35:47,580
Yan Shang,

619
00:35:49,220 --> 00:35:49,660
(Yizhuo Gate)
I'll take my leave.

620
00:35:52,820 --> 00:35:57,100
(Gathering Auspice)

621
00:36:26,260 --> 00:36:27,420
I, Feng Xianyu,

622
00:36:27,860 --> 00:36:29,140
pay my respects to Your Highness!

623
00:36:32,900 --> 00:36:33,460
Rise.

624
00:36:35,620 --> 00:36:36,420
Thank you, Your Highness.

625
00:36:40,460 --> 00:36:41,260
Stand up.

626
00:36:44,420 --> 00:36:45,220
Let me have a look at you.

627
00:36:51,300 --> 00:36:52,060
Very good.

628
00:36:53,580 --> 00:36:54,940
You've come to the right person

629
00:36:55,860 --> 00:36:57,020
for a recommendation.

630
00:36:57,340 --> 00:37:00,220
I'd gladly play music, paint,

631
00:37:00,380 --> 00:37:01,300
and admire flowers

632
00:37:01,580 --> 00:37:03,100
with Your Highness.

633
00:37:03,180 --> 00:37:03,980
Come in.

634
00:37:06,660 --> 00:37:07,340
Feng Xianyu,

635
00:37:08,420 --> 00:37:09,780
take a good look.

636
00:37:11,180 --> 00:37:11,980
Tell me,

637
00:37:12,540 --> 00:37:14,540
which of them couldn't do what you can?

638
00:37:15,300 --> 00:37:16,460
Since you've come seeking my help,

639
00:37:16,900 --> 00:37:17,820
you may stay here, too.

640
00:37:18,340 --> 00:37:18,780
Your Highness!

641
00:37:19,820 --> 00:37:21,060
I have a wife and daughter.

642
00:37:21,460 --> 00:37:23,460
I can't be Your Highness's
male favorite.

643
00:37:23,780 --> 00:37:24,820
You don't want to stay?

644
00:37:25,420 --> 00:37:26,340
Then get out!

645
00:37:29,420 --> 00:37:31,580
One day, you'll understand.

646
00:37:34,860 --> 00:37:35,300
Get out!

647
00:38:00,100 --> 00:38:00,500
Captain!

648
00:38:01,260 --> 00:38:02,700
A student wishes to see you.

649
00:38:03,340 --> 00:38:04,460
What does a student want with me?

650
00:38:04,580 --> 00:38:05,300
I can't even read.

651
00:38:05,820 --> 00:38:06,140
Send him away.

652
00:38:06,940 --> 00:38:07,380
Captain!

653
00:38:07,860 --> 00:38:09,460
He's a student at the Imperial Academy.

654
00:38:09,820 --> 00:38:11,140
He's come seeking your recommendation.

655
00:38:11,500 --> 00:38:12,100
Want a recommendation?

656
00:38:12,820 --> 00:38:13,380
From me?

657
00:38:17,820 --> 00:38:19,780
Greetings, Captain. I'm Yan Shang.

658
00:38:21,980 --> 00:38:23,060
Your name is Yan Shang?

659
00:38:24,860 --> 00:38:25,220
Yes.

660
00:38:36,260 --> 00:38:38,660
Why do you look so familiar?

661
00:38:39,380 --> 00:38:40,500
I was fortunate enough

662
00:38:40,980 --> 00:38:42,700
to meet you at Cuiyun Tower
the other day.

663
00:39:20,980 --> 00:39:21,380
No, wait.

664
00:39:23,620 --> 00:39:24,380
It wasn't at Cuiyun Tower.

665
00:39:26,980 --> 00:39:28,860
I've definitely seen you before.

666
00:39:34,820 --> 00:39:36,580
You have a remarkable memory, Captain.

667
00:39:37,500 --> 00:39:39,060
At Caimei Ridge in Lingnan Circuit,

668
00:39:39,940 --> 00:39:41,420
I ran into you
outside the county office.

669
00:39:47,060 --> 00:39:48,100
(Santu County Office)

670
00:39:49,300 --> 00:39:51,300
(Santu County Office)

671
00:40:07,660 --> 00:40:08,220
Now I remember!

672
00:40:10,020 --> 00:40:10,500
That's where I've seen you!

673
00:40:12,700 --> 00:40:14,100
I've long admired you, Captain.

674
00:40:16,380 --> 00:40:17,060
What a coincidence.

675
00:40:17,940 --> 00:40:19,620
I ran into you again at Cuiyun Tower.

676
00:40:20,180 --> 00:40:21,300
Because of you,

677
00:40:21,860 --> 00:40:23,460
Xu Mianmian, that little hussy,

678
00:40:23,460 --> 00:40:25,140
got away from me!

679
00:40:26,500 --> 00:40:27,140
Please calm down, Captain.

680
00:40:27,780 --> 00:40:29,580
I got carried away that day

681
00:40:30,340 --> 00:40:31,700
and approached you without thinking.

682
00:40:32,660 --> 00:40:34,660
I didn't mean to spoil your fun.

683
00:40:38,220 --> 00:40:39,540
At least you've got good taste.

684
00:40:41,060 --> 00:40:42,340
I'll remember you from now on.

685
00:40:43,260 --> 00:40:44,540
You're seeking a recommendation, right?

686
00:40:45,260 --> 00:40:46,100
Let me see your work.

687
00:40:49,340 --> 00:40:50,180
Please give me your guidance.

688
00:40:58,140 --> 00:41:01,260
(Am I supposed to critique it, too?)

689
00:41:03,340 --> 00:41:05,140
(Content of the Essay)
(Where does it begin?)

690
00:41:05,500 --> 00:41:07,540
(Content of the Essay)
(Where does it end?)

691
00:41:16,940 --> 00:41:19,220
My knowledge is limited,
and my writing is poor.

692
00:41:19,540 --> 00:41:20,060
I'm afraid

693
00:41:20,860 --> 00:41:21,900
it won't meet your standards.

694
00:41:24,020 --> 00:41:25,180
It's not very good.

695
00:41:25,580 --> 00:41:26,340
And you expect me

696
00:41:26,700 --> 00:41:28,700
to recommend this to Lord Yu?

697
00:41:29,020 --> 00:41:30,220
I'd be a laughingstock!

698
00:41:31,460 --> 00:41:32,300
I'm deeply ashamed.

699
00:41:33,180 --> 00:41:34,780
Your critique alone is an honor.

700
00:41:35,980 --> 00:41:37,780
I wouldn't dare presume to meet Lord Yu.

701
00:41:38,860 --> 00:41:39,940
(Forget you, boy.)

702
00:41:40,860 --> 00:41:43,340
(Even I can barely get an audience
with Lord Yu.)

703
00:41:44,980 --> 00:41:45,900
A recommendation

704
00:41:46,820 --> 00:41:47,820
isn't out of the question.

705
00:41:49,580 --> 00:41:50,700
How much are you willing to pay?

706
00:41:54,020 --> 00:41:54,980
I'm ashamed to say it,

707
00:41:55,940 --> 00:41:57,660
but I'm short on money.

708
00:41:59,580 --> 00:41:59,900
However,

709
00:42:00,700 --> 00:42:02,140
if there's anything else you need,

710
00:42:02,740 --> 00:42:04,740
I'll gladly do my best to help!

711
00:42:09,420 --> 00:42:11,540
But now that you're in Sheng'an,

712
00:42:11,940 --> 00:42:13,540
you can get whatever you want.

713
00:42:14,460 --> 00:42:16,380
Even if I wanted to be of use,

714
00:42:16,940 --> 00:42:17,460
I'm afraid

715
00:42:18,220 --> 00:42:19,500
I'm not even fit to tie your boots.

716
00:42:22,060 --> 00:42:23,740
With those skinny arms and legs,

717
00:42:23,740 --> 00:42:24,860
what could you possibly do for me?

718
00:42:25,860 --> 00:42:27,980
Well, I do have a problem.

719
00:42:29,180 --> 00:42:29,820
Xu Mianmian

720
00:42:30,380 --> 00:42:31,260
at Cuiyun Tower

721
00:42:32,420 --> 00:42:33,380
doesn't know what's good for her.

722
00:42:34,540 --> 00:42:35,660
She refuses to serve me.

723
00:42:36,100 --> 00:42:38,060
Get her to give in,

724
00:42:38,180 --> 00:42:40,060
and I'll reward you handsomely.

725
00:42:43,660 --> 00:42:44,820
Captain, you're tough as iron.

726
00:42:45,460 --> 00:42:46,860
You may not understand women.

727
00:42:47,740 --> 00:42:49,700
Kindness works better than force.

728
00:42:50,420 --> 00:42:51,700
Give me a few days.

729
00:42:52,340 --> 00:42:54,460
I'll take care of it.

730
00:43:00,780 --> 00:43:02,060
You'd better.

731
00:43:03,860 --> 00:43:04,500
You scholars...

732
00:43:05,220 --> 00:43:05,780
You're always

733
00:43:06,380 --> 00:43:07,100
full of clever tricks.

734
00:43:08,700 --> 00:43:10,300
Pull this off,

735
00:43:11,660 --> 00:43:13,500
and I'll make you the top scholar!

736
00:43:18,180 --> 00:43:18,860
Leave it to me.

737
00:43:19,300 --> 00:43:20,100
Just wait for my word.

738
00:43:53,780 --> 00:43:56,620
(Zhang Renjing)

739
00:44:00,100 --> 00:44:02,740
(Yu Cheng'an, Zhang Renjing)

740
00:44:22,380 --> 00:44:27,100
(Next Episode Preview)

741
00:44:27,700 --> 00:44:29,700
The Peony Goddess at Sigui Garden

742
00:44:29,980 --> 00:44:31,860
is said to grant prayers for children.

743
00:44:32,420 --> 00:44:34,020
The Peony Festival is tomorrow.

744
00:44:34,820 --> 00:44:35,900
Why not come with me?

745
00:44:36,460 --> 00:44:37,420
Thank you for the kind invitation.

746
00:44:37,580 --> 00:44:38,820
The festival will be crowded.

747
00:44:39,140 --> 00:44:39,860
I'm not used to crowds.

748
00:44:43,441 --> 00:44:46,734
♪Be the ferry
where you wait for the sun♪

749
00:44:49,419 --> 00:44:54,335
♪Be the blue silk
that catches your tears♪

750
00:44:56,529 --> 00:45:02,374
♪Be the sleeve we held,
worn by dust and years♪

751
00:45:02,874 --> 00:45:08,100
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

752
00:45:10,869 --> 00:45:15,660
♪Let me be a captive beast
bound by the same lock as you♪

753
00:45:16,496 --> 00:45:22,575
♪Through trails of mud and blood;
let grief drown in your eyes♪

754
00:45:24,376 --> 00:45:27,526
♪Soar with the wind;
plunge into hellfire as one♪

755
00:45:27,526 --> 00:45:29,174
♪Burning bright as a song♪

756
00:45:29,226 --> 00:45:32,950
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

757
00:45:33,328 --> 00:45:37,994
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

758
00:45:38,613 --> 00:45:42,654
♪If we say forever,
then forever it shall be♪

759
00:45:43,145 --> 00:45:45,260
♪Not a single hour less♪

760
00:45:45,300 --> 00:45:52,246
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

761
00:45:53,009 --> 00:45:56,462
♪We'll be gods above,
or wandering souls♪

762
00:45:56,642 --> 00:45:59,787
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

763
00:46:00,226 --> 00:46:06,863
♪If we can stay, let's return
to the village of our first meeting♪

764
00:46:07,260 --> 00:46:11,774
♪May time be free of fear and pain;
boats rock, lights fade, seasons turn♪

765
00:46:11,812 --> 00:46:14,281
♪You're the only one I need♪

766
00:46:14,485 --> 00:46:21,372
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

767
00:46:21,684 --> 00:46:24,955
♪Be mine in this world;
be mine in this life♪

768
00:46:25,260 --> 00:46:28,433
♪My last untouched innocence♪

769
00:46:28,757 --> 00:46:32,183
♪If only we could return
to the village where we first met♪

770
00:46:32,416 --> 00:46:35,641
♪Stay by me; help me forget
the frozen dream of last night♪

771
00:46:35,972 --> 00:46:42,768
♪Fireflies glow, flowers kiss our lips;
just us, through dawn and dusk♪

772
00:46:43,137 --> 00:46:47,703
♪May time be free of fear and pain;
boats rock, lights fade, seasons turn♪

773
00:46:47,750 --> 00:46:50,088
♪You're the only one I need♪

774
00:46:50,319 --> 00:46:57,154
♪By your side, through joy and pain,
is that eternity?♪

775
00:46:57,503 --> 00:46:59,121
♪Till fireworks flood the town♪

776
00:46:59,251 --> 00:47:01,047
♪Till the lake is still and clear♪

777
00:47:01,404 --> 00:47:04,421
♪You're the only one I need♪

778
00:47:04,461 --> 00:47:05,788
(No animals were harmed
or mistreated in production.)
